Z||000000||rodmcneill||04-20-2001||10:39 AM||||Excuse my ignorance on computers folks, but how do I in a topic or a response highlight a website,other topic or thread so that when you click on it, it goes to that site. Still learning the 'puters.||||reg||5
Z||000001||Cliff Pennock||04-20-2001||11:33 AM||||It's not possible in the topic, and in a message it's automatic. Just make sure the web address starts with <B>h</B><B>ttp://</B> like in <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl</A>  (notice how the forum automatically changed that into a link?).||||reg||1
